---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout title="Compare — TotalRecalls" description="TotalRecalls vs official downloads and DIY scripts." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Compare" }]}>
  <h1>Compare</h1>
  <p>How TotalRecalls stacks up against the two realistic alternatives: each provider's official download, and do-it-yourself scripts.</p>

  <table class="compare-table">
  <thead>
  <tr>
    <th>Feature</th><th>Official downloads</th><th>DIY scripts</th><th>TotalRecalls</th>
  </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  <tr>
    <td>Formats</td>
    <td>JSON dump (machine-only)</td>
    <td>Whatever you write</td>
    <td>Markdown + JSON (human + machine)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Bulk download</td>
    <td>Manual, one provider at a time</td>
    <td>You maintain the script</td>
    <td>All eight providers in one app</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Setup</td>
    <td>Per-provider download flows</td>
    <td>Hours of scripting + debugging</td>
    <td>Unzip and run (Windows)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Migration</td>
    <td>Not supported</td>
    <td>Up to you</td>
    <td>Unified Library folder, portable anywhere</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Full-text search across providers</td>
    <td>No</td>
    <td>Possible with extra tooling</td>
    <td><em>Planned</em> (optional upgrade)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Folder sync (cloud / NAS)</td>
    <td>No</td>
    <td>Manual</td>
    <td><em>Planned</em> — today: sync the folder yourself</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Cost</td>
    <td>Free (data locked in)</td>
    <td>Free (your time)</td>
    <td>$24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span> one-time (data fully yours)</td>
  </tr>
  </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><a href="/pricing/" class="buy-button buy-lg" data-tr-buy>Get TotalRecalls — <span data-tr-price>$24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></span></a></p>

  <h2>Head-to-head, by provider</h2>
  <p>See exactly what each provider's official export gives you — and what TotalRecalls adds on top.</p>
  <div class="compare-cards">
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/chatgpt/">ChatGPT <span>vs. OpenAI's JSON dump</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/claude/">Claude <span>vs. Anthropic's export</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/perplexity/">Perplexity <span>vs. the official backup</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/gemini/">Gemini <span>vs. Google Takeout</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/grok/">Grok <span>vs. manual saving</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/deepseek/">DeepSeek <span>vs. manual saving</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/mistral/">Mistral <span>vs. manual saving</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/qwen/">Qwen <span>vs. manual saving</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/pricing/">Pricing <span>what the alternatives cost</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/why-local/">Why Local <span>your data, your machine</span></a>
    <a class="compare-card" href="/compare/why-multi-assistant/">Why Multi-Assistant <span>one library, eight providers</span></a>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .compare-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(210px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
  }
  .compare-card {
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-foreground, #0b0f19);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .compare-card span {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--color-muted, #64748b);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .compare-card:hover { border-color: var(--color-primary, #2f7bff); }
</style>
